 "text": "Voltage stabilizers\n\nVoltage stabilizers or also called voltage regulators or voltage regulators. They can be electronic and electromechanical with servomotor, for single-phase or three-phase installations.\n\nUsed to maintain the installation’s mains voltage stable. \n\nExplore subcategories\nAVS Series Stabilizers: electromechanical with servo motor\nElectromechanical stabilizer driven by servomotor. Designed under strict standards of quality and mechanical and electrical robustness, where performance and reliability are paramount. Stabilization is achieved by continuously comparing the input voltage with the nominal output voltage, and adjusting the operating point of the variable transformer by means of a servomotor to achieve the nominal output voltage. It has digital output voltage indicators, as well as equipment status indicators.\nLearn more\nBAVS Series: Electronics\nBinary voltage stabilizer electronically controlled by IGBT, is specially designed to work in very complex circumstances, both for power and constant variations, both in voltage and current. Always offering a very high level of stabilization, with variations of less than 1% and with a harmonic factor < 0.5%.\nLearn more\n\nTorivac-Products\n\n×\n\nProducts\n\nTransformers\n\n+\n\nConventional transformer\n\nToroidal transformers\n\nVoltage variators - Adjustable autotransformers\n\n+\n\nCustom manufacturing\n\nDesktop equipment\n\nDouble Variator\n\nRegulating accessories\n\nSingle Phase Inverters\n\nThree-phase drives\n\nVoltage stabilizers\n\n+\n\nAVS Series Stabilizers: electromechanical with servo motor\n\nBAVS Series: Electronics\n\nRheostats and coiled potentiometers\n\n+\n\nCeramic rheostats\n\nPotentiometers\n\nEncapsulated coils\n\n+\n\nRound\n\nSquares\n\nChokes | Inductances | Toroidal Reactances\n\n+\n\nNuclei\n\n+\n\nPortaled\n\n+\n\nled 10mm\n\nled 3mm\n\nled 5mm\n\nled 8mm\n\nSockets\n\n+\n\nHB4 socket\n\nHSR4 safety socket\n\nSafety socket HBS4\n\nsafety socket HR4\n\nControl buttons\n\n+\n\nArrow Discs\n\nArrow hoops\n\nBM series control buttons (Matte)\n\nBM Series Covers\n\nBO series control buttons (bright)\n\nBO Series control buttons with line\n\nBO series covers\n\nCasing covers\n\nEstators\n\nGraded covers\n\nGraduated discs\n\nResistors : Load banks\n\n+\n\nBoxed\n\nBraking resistors\n\nCemented\n\nGrounding resistors\n\nHelical\n\nLoad banks\n\nStarting resistors\n\nElectronic equipment\n\n+\n\nConverters\n\nDC power supplies\n\nIndustrial control\n\nRenewable energies",
